{"code":"105330","name":"케이엔더블유","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"반도체와반도체장비","sector_desc":"메모리·비메모리 반도체와 그 제조 장비·소재. 글로벌 IT 수요와 메모리 가격 사이클을 따라 움직입니다.","desc":"동사는 2001년 설립되어 2009년 코스닥에 상장되었으며, 비지에프에코스페셜티, 북경특가기차령부건유한공사, K.N.W Vietnam을 보유하고 있음. 전자부품소재, 자동차부품소재, 반도체소재 사업부문 보유하며, 경기도 파주시, 울산광역시, 중국, 베트남에 생산시설 있음. 비지에프에코스페셜티는 반도체 소재사업 강화를 위해 2026년 완공 목표로 무수불산 제조시설을 구축하고 국내 공급망을 안정화하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-29","n_days":300,"close":7390.0,"open":7500.0,"high":7570.0,"low":7200.0,"volume":11441,"amount":84548990.0,"ret_1d":0.4076,"gap":1.9022,"range_pct":5.0068,"ret_5":2.0718,"ret_20":-10.4242,"ret_60":39.434,"ret_120":-29.2146,"ret_250":34.854,"ma20":7913.0,"ma60":7346.5,"ma120":7831.8333,"ma200":7479.475,"close_vs_ma200":-1.1963,"close_vs_ma60":0.5921,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":163.0337,"r2_60":0.4625,"slope_120":-42.3999,"r2_120":0.2148,"slope_250":47.256,"r2_250":0.2835,"high52":11400.0,"low52":4785.0,"pos_52w":39.3802,"dd_52w":-35.1754,"mdd_1y":-50.6518,"atr14_pct":6.9785,"vol_ann_60":56.3603,"vol_avg20":490852.15,"vol_ratio20":0.0233,"vr5":0.1002,"vr20":7.3014,"amount_avg5":138269542.0,"amount_avg20":4486060866.0,"amount_avg60":1653866458.1667,"obv_chg20":92.0442,"turnover_20":61.2818,"pv_eff_20":-0.1701,"rsi14":43.862,"frgn_net_5":-10639.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0664,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0664,"frgn_net_20":-69066.0,"inst_net_20":10000.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.4311,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0624,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.3687,"frgn_net_60":-59580.0,"inst_net_60":33629.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.3719,"inst_net_60_pct":0.2099,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.162,"frgn_net_120":-54105.0,"inst_net_120":43449.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.3377,"inst_net_120_pct":0.2712,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.0665,"foreign_ratio":0.96,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.33,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":-18.0,"op_margin_q":-9.7826,"op_qoq":-63.6364,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-260.0,"rev_yoy":-8.9109,"op_trend_4q":-38.1395,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-9.63,"debt_ratio"